5,1,1,talk,Midori,,I’m a bit nervous about jumping straight into vendor names. Can we first agree on what actually went wrong with our last system?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We need to understand the operational reality before evaluating solutions. What specific failures do you consider most critical?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,"Let’s not romanticize the past. The real issue is that our systems quietly age in place, and outsourced work comes back broken.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I’d focus on the people. We’re losing key admins, and the crews are stretched thin. How does the change land on them?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I’d add the bill. We approve capital, ignore operating costs, and then wonder why the total keeps climbing. What’s the real lifetime price?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, that lifetime cost point is vital. @May, I worry the plan will drift from reality again. Let’s pick two things to check first.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Midori, I need to verify the physical constraints. I will check the depot calendar and the yard devices to see if our infrastructure can actually support a new system.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, checking the yard is smart. I’ll look into the dispatch tool’s upgrade history and that 2018 data lift to see how we handle aging tech and messy migrations.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Ryuji, the yard is critical. I’ll check the administrator retirements and the depot supervisors to see how the change lands on our people.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll examine the board minutes and the renewal invoices. I need to see how we actually approve money versus what we pay later.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
